WEBVTT

00:08:29.421 --> 00:08:33.050
to answer for, actually,
all the sins of big tech.

00:08:33.384 --> 00:08:36.220
Mark Zuckerberg, though,
takes a conciliatory stance.

00:08:36.262 --> 00:08:41.892
He asks only to be allowed to help write
the regulations that will govern his firm,

00:08:41.934 --> 00:08:46.272
and, coincidentally,
those of his competitors.

00:08:47.189 --> 00:08:49.567
Here's where it gets
a little complicated, though,

00:08:49.567 --> 00:08:52.820
because even as some legislators
are working with Facebook lobbyists

00:08:52.820 --> 00:08:54.488
to write rules for the industry,

00:08:54.488 --> 00:08:58.909
others have introduced a bill
to break up Facebook

00:08:58.951 --> 00:09:02.538
and punish it for its sheer size.